<title>SPAIN: Two killed as Britons' coach crashes in Majorca.</title>
<headline>Two killed as Britons' coach crashes in Majorca.</headline>
<dateline>PALMA DE MALLORCA, Spain 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two people died and 39 were injured early on Friday the Spanish island of Majorca when a car crashed head-on with a bus driving British tourists back to their hotels after a night out, police said.</p>
<p>The two dead were the Spanish driver of the car and a 30-year-old British woman who was not immediately identified.</p>
